#    14-byte payload = 6 FF bytes + 7 CF1 + 1 CF2 byte; completes normally.
0   7E8 RX 10 0E 00 00 00 00 00 00
100 7E0 TX 30 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
120 7E8 RX 21 01 02 03 04 05 06 07
140 7E8 RX 22 08 09 0A 0B 0C 0D 0E
